{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire &amp; Convert</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No permanent allies or enemies\u2014only tactical value. Recruit, betray, and adapt your army to control the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/Feature-1.gif?t=1744870991\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smart Positioning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tiny move can change everything. Perfect your unit placement to control who fights whom and maximize their potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/Feature_FindTarget-1.gif?t=1744870991\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kite, focus fire, and exploit synergies. Outsmart stronger foes by mastering unit strengths and battlefield positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/Feature-4.gif?t=1744870991\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Auto-Chess Puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test strategies, refine your approach, and watch your mercenaries fight\u2014if they\u2019ll listen to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981240/extras/Feature-2.gif?t=1744870991\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite Layouts, Endless Solutions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The emergent puzzles in this game offer infinite potential\u2014every layout presents a fresh and thrilling challenge to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2981240?t=1744870991","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2981240?t=1744870991","capsule_image":"https://sha